    K -->|Yes, due date changed, DIR only| L["Carve-out: update InstallmentDueDate in place<br/>(open AND completed); SLADueDate + parent table's<br/>InsertedDate frozen once complete; audit note<br/>always logged; RETURN"]
    K -->|Yes, no change| M[Suppress: log to DedupLog, RETURN]
    K -->|No match| N["Legacy exact-match check on<br/>tbl_ExceptionQueue itself<br/>(TaxYear+InstallmentNo+Lender+Cust+Contract+...)"]
    N -->|Exists, any completion status| O[Archive old row, update wide columns<br/>in place - legacy path, not modified this ticket]
    N -->|Does not exist| P[Insert brand-new ExceptionQueue /<br/>UserTracking / Tax_Info rows - not traced<br/>line-by-line this session]
