## 4. Tables used — full list

| Database | Table | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `LASTotalTaxSolution` | `lais_PayeeCalendar` | Source of truth for ELD (Estimated Last Date) due dates per agency/tax-year/installment. Columns: `PayeeID`, `CurrentTaxYear` *(the installment's own year — not the agency's)*, `Installment`, `RunCode` (`ELDH`/`ELDX`/`ELD0` — "latest wins" tie-break), `DueDate`. |
| `LASCommon` | `tbl_Config_Master` | Holds `StartDays`/`EndDays` (`ConfigSystemCode='EPQ'`) — eligibility is an exact `= @StartDays` match; `EndDays` is still read but unused since the 20-60 day catch-up window was reverted 11/12. |
| `LASCommon` | `lac_AgencyProfile` | `CURRENT_TAX_YEAR` — the agency's actual active tax year (Gap 2's comparison target). Also `Late_Rels` (`'U'` = excluded). |
| `LASCommon` | `lac_CustomerProfile` | Customer name lookup when building staging rows. |
| `LASTax` | `Lat_LienMasterKey` | One row per lien (TaxID+PropertyID+LienSEQ) per loan. `LenderID`, `Statecode`, `TaxServiceType` (`'B'` required), `PayeeID`. A loan can have multiple liens → multiple queue rows per loan is normal. |
| `LASTax` | `lat_ContractMasterKey` | Contract-level data; `LCR_CANCEL_CODE` (`'C'` = cancelled, routes elsewhere entirely). |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue_Assign_ExceptionService` | Per Lender+State config; `DLQResearchInd='1'` required for DIR eligibility. Sparse on DEV. |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue_Staging` | Truncated and rebuilt every run; one row per loan+lien combination currently in scope. Cursor source for the main processing loop. |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue` | The parent queue table — `InsertedDate` (first-load timestamp, refreshed only by the brand-new-insert path), `Updatedate`/`UpdatedBy` (never touched by this SP). Also still carries some legacy "wide" columns (`TaxYear`, `InstallmentNo`, `DLQResearchInd`, etc.) used by an older code path alongside the newer child tables below. |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue_UserTracking` | Child table: `SystemCode`, `SeqNo`, `isComplete` — one row per system code per exception. |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue_Tax_Info` | Child table: `TaxYear`, `InstallmentNo`, `InstallmentDueDate`, `SLADueDate`, `Updatedate`, `UpdatedBy` — the newer, normalized per-installment detail. |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue_DedupLog` | Audit log of suppressed duplicate attempts (`WinnerExceptionID`/`WinnerSeqNo` columns, matching the SP's own `@Winner*` local variable names). |
| `LASTax` | `tbl_ExceptionQueue_Archive` | Snapshot of a queue row's wide columns taken right before the legacy exact-match path updates it in place. |

